TRAINING PHASE (Before the model learns anything)
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Step 1: Read the label JSON file
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ {                                               │
│   "0": "apple scab",      ← Position 0         │
│   "1": "apple rust",      ← Position 1         │
│   "2": "apple black rot", ← Position 2         │
│   "3": "grape leaf blight", ← Position 3       │
│   ...                                          │
│   "7": "tomato mosaic virus" ← Position 7      │
│ }                                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Step 2: Build the mapping in memory
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ label_to_index = {                              │
│   "apple scab": 0,          ← For training     │
│   "apple rust": 1,          ← Convert labels   │
│   "apple black rot": 2,     ← to numbers       │
│   "grape leaf blight": 3,                       │
│   ...                                          │
│   "tomato mosaic virus": 7                      │
│ }                                               │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Step 3: Train the model
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Image of apple scab → Model → Outputs: 0        │
│ Image of tomato mosaic virus → Model → Outputs: 7 │
│ Image of apple rust → Model → Outputs: 1        │
│ ... (millions of adjustments)                   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

After training: The model has learned:
  "If you see circular brown spots on an apple → output 0"
  "If you see yellow mottling on tomato leaves → output 7"




  this is necessary because before training



BEFORE TRAINING (Epoch -1) ← THIS IS WHERE IT MUST HAPPEN
├── Read JSON file
├── Build label_to_index dictionary
├── Verify order is consistent
├── Save the order to a separate file (class_names.json)
└── NOW training can begin

DURING TRAINING (Epoch 1-50)
├── Model learns: "Image X → output Y"
├── Model has NO concept of disease names
├── Model only knows numbers
└── The mapping is FROZEN (never changes)

AFTER TRAINING (Inference time)
├── Model outputs: 7
├── Look up 7 in label_to_index dict
├── Return: "tomato mosaic virus"
└── This ONLY works if order hasn't changed!

